 3568                   ;   Function to write the net sequential record.
 3569                   ;
 3570 E0E6  CD E051     WRTSEQ:	CALL	AUTOSEL		;select proper drive then write.
 3571 E0E9  C3 DDFE     	JP	WTSEQ
